<title>PERU: Peru's Banco Wiese 11-month net.</title>
<headline>Peru's Banco Wiese 11-month net.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended November 30.</p>
<p>Share n.a.</p>
